#N canvas 120 60 900 460 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_viz <name> <port> - forwards this sensor's sphere data (aim + sphere \, from the Pi's Alignment stage) to the browser viewer: python tools/sphere_viz.py (listens on 12346). Inlet: 1 = on \, 0 = off (default off \, so nothing is sent when the viewer isn't running). Sends to 127.0.0.1 as /fs/<name>/aim and /fs/<name>/sphere., f 110;
#X obj 20 110 inlet;
#X obj 20 140 t f f;
#X obj 20 180 sel 0;
#X msg 20 220 disconnect;
#X obj 110 220 t b;
#X obj 110 250 f \$2;
#X msg 110 280 connect 127.0.0.1 \$1;
#X obj 20 360 netsend -u -b;
#X obj 400 110 fs_in \$1 aim;
#X obj 400 180 spigot;
#X obj 400 250 oscformat fs \$1 aim;
#X obj 620 110 fs_in \$1 sphere;
#X obj 620 180 spigot;
#X obj 620 250 oscformat fs \$1 sphere;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 1 10 1;
#X connect 2 1 13 1;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 3 1 5 0;
#X connect 5 0 6 0;
#X connect 6 0 7 0;
#X connect 4 0 8 0;
#X connect 7 0 8 0;
#X connect 9 0 10 0;
#X connect 10 0 11 0;
#X connect 11 0 8 0;
#X connect 12 0 13 0;
#X connect 13 0 14 0;
#X connect 14 0 8 0;
